class UsmtfMessageIdentificationType:
    """
    See annotations in child elements and messages/elements that use this
    type for details.

    :ivar identification_choice_type: Indicates the designated codename
        or nickname for an exercise or operation.
    :ivar originator: Indicates the originator of the USMTF message.
        Derived from MIL-STD-6040.
    :ivar serial_number: Indicates the serial number assigned to a
        specific message. The originating command may develop the
        message serial number by any method. Derived from MIL-STD-6040.
    :ivar qualifier: A qualifier which caveats a message status. Derived
        from MIL-STD-6040.
    :ivar qualifier_serial_number: A number assigned serially to
        identify the sequential version of a message qualifier for a
        basic message. Derived from MIL-STD-6040.
    """

