@dataclass(kw_only=True)
class SupportPlanConstraintType:
    """
    See annotations in child elements and messages/elements that use this
    type for details.

    :ivar support_plan_id: Indicates the unique ID of the SupportPlan
        being referenced.  When omitted, the current/active SupportPlan
        for the System is implied.
    :ivar changeable_allocations: Indicates which kinds/categories of
        Supports in the SupportPlan indicated by the sibling
        SupportPlanID are considered changeable.  The exact definition
        of "changeable" is left to particular Services and/or Systems to
        develop according to their requirements.  A lenient
        interpretation would equate "changeable" with "removal allowed"
        thereby giving a System and/or planning Service freedom to
        remove any changeable Supports from the constraining plan in
        order to optimize a new *Plan for new and/or unchangeable
        Supports.  Those removed Supports would then be dealt with in
        subsequent planning steps/iterations.   With this definition, an
        "unchangeable" Support item is "System/vehicle constrained" and
        therefore the new *Plan being developed should avoid changes
        that would cause the item to be removed.  A stricter
        interpretation might additionally require that any temporal
        constraints of an unchangeable Support from the constraining
        SupportPlan be unchanged as a result of the new *Plan being
        developed.  In a System of Systems with inter-*Plan temporal
        dependencies, this stricter interpretation could reduce
        automated replanning chain reactions.
    :ivar support_type: Indicates a type of Support in the SupportPlan
        referenced by the sibling SupportPlanID element that constrains
        the new *Plan.  If any are given, only Support of the specified
        type or types are constraints.  If omitted, all Support types
        are constraints.
    """

    support_plan_id: None | SupportPlanIdType = field(
        default=None,
        metadata={
            "name": "SupportPlanID",
            "type": "Element",
            "namespace": "https://www.vdl.afrl.af.mil/programs/oam",
        },
    )
    changeable_allocations: PlanChangeableConstraintsEnum = field(
        metadata={
            "name": "ChangeableAllocations",
            "type": "Element",
            "namespace": "https://www.vdl.afrl.af.mil/programs/oam",
        }
    )
    support_type: None | RequirementTaxonomyType = field(
        default=None,
        metadata={
            "name": "SupportType",
            "type": "Element",
            "namespace": "https://www.vdl.afrl.af.mil/programs/oam",
        },
    )


