@dataclass(kw_only=True)
class SpaceCharacteristicsType:
    """
    See annotations in child elements and messages/elements that use this
    type for details.

    :ivar bus_type: Satellite bus type. This could be machine readable
        and/or an index into a non-UCI config file.
    :ivar mission_type: The intended mission or missions of the
        satellite. List size for this element is based on "Select All
        That Apply" condition.
    :ivar mass: Indicates the satellite total (wet) mass at time of
        launch.
    :ivar physical_configuration: Indicates the physical configuration
        and appearance of the space object.  When more than one is
        given, the satellite has multiple configurations with different
        sizes and appearances.
    :ivar characteristics_product_id: A reference to metadata for a
        product which conveys characteristics of the satellite. For
        example, a reference image of the satellite type.
    :ivar characteristics_file_id: A reference to metadata for a file
        which conveys characteristics of the satellite.  For example, a
        non-Product image or a CAD model of the satellite's physical
        characteristics.
    :ivar comm_link: Indicates a comms link of the satellite.
    :ivar flight_rule: Indicates a flight rule for the satellite.
    """

