@dataclass(kw_only=True)
class ProductDownloadRequest(ProductDownloadRequestMt):
    """
    This message is a request that a file or files to be downloaded.

    In some cases, a product may reside on a system in a location that is
    not reachable by other UCI services via a network URI. This message is
    intended to request that a product be downloaded to a location where
    other services can reach it via a network URI. An example of this is a
    product that has been stored on-board a vehicle but has not been
    downloaded. A Product Download Request directly invokes functionality
    to download a product. Execution of the download request would result
    in a Product Download Request Status followed by a Product Download
    Report. There are 2 ways this message can be generated. 1.) By the
    operator to command immediate download of a product. 2.) Automated by a
    service as a result of execution of a Download Task. If automatically
    generated as a result of Download Task execution, the download
    requirements would be populated with those specified in the Download
    Task. This allows the default plan to be overridden on a task by task
    basis. UCI_PRIMITIVE: ActionRequest-2.
    """

    class Meta:
        namespace = "https://www.vdl.afrl.af.mil/programs/oam"


