@dataclass(kw_only=True)
class TaskType:
    """
    Identifies the type of this Task instance.

    Note: When modifying this complexType (whether adding or removing
    choices), there are equivalent complexTypes that require the same
    modifications. Changes to this type may necessitate a modification to
    CapabilityTaxonomyType.

    :ivar air_sample: Air sample includes direct sampling of the air
        (SAMPLE) and remote sensing with spectral analysis
        (SPECTROMETER) with the intent of detecting NBC events.
    :ivar amti: Indicates a Task to collect Air Moving Target Indicator
        (AMTI) data.
    :ivar ao: Indicates a Task to perform an optical emission such as
        laser designation.
    :ivar cargo_delivery: Indicates a Task to transfer cargo between
        locations.
    :ivar comint: Indicates a Task to provide COMINT.
    :ivar comm_support: Indicates a Task to provide communications.
    :ivar counter_space: Indicates a Task to employ a CounterSpace
        capability.
    :ivar de: Indicates a Task to perform a Directed Energy emission.
    :ivar ea: Indicates a Task to provide electronic attack support to
        another System.  It guides/constrains the EA System by
        specifying where it should fly, what it should protect and what
        the threat is.
    :ivar esm: Indicates a Task to collect ESM data.
    :ivar flight: Indicates a Task to effect the flight path/plan of the
        System.
    :ivar navigation: Indicates a non-orbital Navigation Task.
    :ivar orbit_change: Indicates a task to perform an orbit change via
        a spacecraft maneuver.
    :ivar orbital_surveillance: Indicates an Orbital Surveillance Task.
    :ivar orbital_surveillance_sensor: Indicates a task to perform
        orbital surveillance sensor tasking.
    :ivar po: Indicates a Task to collect Passive Optical data, imagery
        and video as well as perform PO search and track capabilities.
    :ivar refuel: Indicates a Task for one System to refuel another.
    :ivar sar: Indicates a Task to collect a Synthetic Aperture Radar
        (SAR) image.
    :ivar smti: Indicates a Task to collect Moving Target Indicator
        (MTI) data.
    :ivar strike: Indicates a Task to kinetically attack/strike, with a
        weapon that can be released from the System.
    :ivar system_deployment: Indicates a task to perform a deployment or
        release of a system at a specified location.
    :ivar tactical_order: Indicates a task to perform a tactical order.
    :ivar weather_radar: Indicates a task to collect weather radar data.
    """

